+`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py`:
+73 narrowing rows KILLED, 2 supplementary additive rows KILLED
+(D-background-fallback and D-background-fallback-foreground, labeled),
